url: "https://github.com/sizhet/Policy-Driven-Organizational-Synthesis-PDOS"

abstract: >
  Policy-Driven Organizational Synthesis (PDOS) is a computational
  framework for synthesizing, exploiting, and continuously evolving
  organizational structures under explicit policies.
  The repository establishes a unified computational architecture
  connecting Organizational Intelligence, Organizational Routing,
  Localized Runtime Intelligence, Runtime Learning,
  Brain Units, Multi-Policy Runtime Intelligence,
  and Closed-Loop Runtime Organizations.
  Version 1.0 develops the first complete theoretical foundation
  of Policy-Driven Organizational Synthesis across five
  progressively connected parts.

